## qf-bio | Quick-fire: biology | bio | 0 | - | bi-plant
quiz 2 | What organelle is called the powerhouse of the cell?
* Mitochondrion
o Nucleus
o Ribosome
o Golgi apparatus
= It makes most of the cell's ATP.
